NOTICE

png-squeeze-01-run-20261127 entry. The program in main.ts is built from two
parts:

1. Kit-derived parts (make.fun's own, MIT — see LICENSE): the PNG codec and
   the screening forms/filters, taken from the competition kit
   (png-squeeze-01-run-20261127-kit):
     - program/generator/subject/png.mjs — PNG reader/writer (the codec the
       checker itself decodes every answer with)
     - program/generator/subject/scale.mjs — the forms (palette, grey,
       grey+alpha, RGB, RGBA, tRNS key) and filter choices each image is
       screened in, and the scale compressor
   These were assembled into main.ts by the entry's build script
   (build-main.mjs, kept in the work directory, not part of the entry) and
   were not written as original work for this entry.

2. Original work written for this entry: the DEFLATE encoders in main.ts —
   the lazy optimal-parse encoder (deflateOptimal) and the full
   dynamic-programming encoder (deflateDP) — plus the screening driver,
   the encoder selection, and the entry loop.
